 un appareil vapeur ou autre. 

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:43.240 size:46% position:23% line:95%
 On a beaucoup 
 de plates-formes, 

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:46.320 size:61% position:30% line:95%
